100.1

Versioning policy:
- Initial rebuild: 100
- Incremental updates: 100.1 through 100.9
- Next major/minor cycle: 101, then 101.1 through 101.9, and so on.
- Every shipped build must display and be packaged with its exact version.

100.1 performance update:
- Excel/CSV/JSON imports now use one SQLite transaction per file.
- Prepared transaction-bound INSERT statements are used for bulk rows.
- SQLite cache, mmap and busy-timeout tuning added.
- Existing schema, endpoints, matching logic and import mapping are preserved.
